# Privacy Policy – NIT Scanner

**Last updated:** September 10, 2026

NIT Scanner ("we", "our", or "the app") is an Android application designed to scan documents, pages, books, ID cards, and QR codes.

## Information We Collect

NIT Scanner may access your device camera to scan documents, QR codes, and other supported content.

We do not collect or store your scanned documents on our servers unless explicitly stated otherwise in the app.

## Camera Permission

The app requires camera access to provide scanning functionality. Camera access is used only for scanning and processing content within the app.

## Personal Information

We do not knowingly collect personal information such as your name, email address, or phone number through the scanning functionality.

## Third-Party Services

NIT Scanner uses Google ML Kit for supported scanning and recognition features. Third-party services may process information according to their own privacy policies.

## Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information processed through the application.

## Children's Privacy

NIT Scanner is not designed to knowingly collect personal information from children.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page.

## Contact Us

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at nitxy07@gmail.com.

